In summary, by providing additional spatial DoF and adaptively reshaping physical wireless channels, the RIS-assisted secure ISAC  effectively alleviates the resource competition bottleneck between communication and sensing. It enables high-precision beam alignment, directional security enhancement, and effective physical layer interference suppression even under severe channel blockage.
